[10.32737, "o", "cat /app/routenote/MAP.txt && printf '\\n--- usage ---\\n' && cat /app/drawbin/usage.txt"]
[10.328374, "o", "\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[10.329847, "o", "Mill directories:\r\n\r\n- /app/cardhearth\r\n- /app/ovenpit\r\n- /app/ribjoin\r\n- /app/drawbin\r\n- /app/flatpit\r\n- /app/tblwell\r\n- /app/markcue\r\n- /app/routenote\r\n\r\nHelper: /app/hearth.sh\r\n\r\nRecipe file: /app/cardhearth/card.yg\r\n\r\n`sift` loads tables from /app/tblwell/action.tbl after the helper runs.\r\n\r\nScratch dests: /app/treypit\r\n"]
[10.331033, "o", "\r\n--- usage ---\r\n"]
[10.333518, "o", "usage: riftkiln sift SRC DEST\r\n\r\nDEST is an object with yard (string) and members (array). Each members item has kind peg, pen, or clip. A peg has tag and mark strings. A pen has stem (string) and members (same array shape). A clip has stem (string).\r\n\r\nA clip ident that appears after an inner pen close and before that inner pen's enclosing pen closes must be a clip object in the enclosing pen's members array, immediately after that inner pen object. At that cut the enclosing members array has length 2 when the inner pen is the only prior member: the inner pen, then the clip. The inner pen must not grow a clip property.\r\n"]
[10.335388, "o", "\u001b[?2004hroot@8ec7ddda28df:/app# "]
[10.577782, "i", "printf '\\n--- tree ---\\n'; find /app -maxdepth 3 -type f -printf '%p\\n' | sort | sed -n '1,240p'; printf '\\n--- binary ---\\n'; file /app/bin/riftkiln; head -c 4 /app/bin/riftkiln | od -An -tx1\n"]
[10.578331, "o", "printf '\\n--- tree ---\\n'; find /app -maxdepth 3 -type f -printf '%p\\n' | sort | sed -n '1,240p'; printf '\\n--- binary ---\\n'; file /app/bin/riftkiln; head -c 4 /app/bin/riftkiln | od -An -tx1\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
